      "updated": 1781010879884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sub-agent roles (9) · memory · tool scope (advisory in v1)\n\n1. Root Orchestrator   session   spawn + builds session-snapshot index\n2. Bead Orchestrator   bead      spawn + commit + diagnosis routing + livelock\n3. Decomposer          none      Read-only · typed relates_to (5 kinds)\n4. Scout               none      Read + grep + AST\n5. Engineer            bead      Write/Edit (gated) + Read + scoped Bash\n6. Verifier            none      Read-only · fresh per call · polarity-aware\n7. Test Runner         bead      Read + Bash(test-runner-cmd)\n8. Author              dialog    Authoring + Read · polarity-decision skill\n9. Conflict Resolver   none      Git ops + R/W · decorator-aware merge\n\nEngineer ⊥ Verifier asymmetry — PROTECTED (round-3):\n  Engineer persistent per bead → accumulates context via\n      structured DUAL-CHANNEL bead memory (impl + test-authoring)\n  Verifier fresh per call → spawn payload IDENTICAL across iters\n      Diagnosis goes to Bead Orchestrator ONLY (never Verifier)\n  Validated by fresh-Verifier audit (3 axes incl. citation precision)\n\nKey skills (round-3):\n  verifier · polarity-aware-evaluation\n           · implies-evaluation (deterministic antecedents)\n           · quantifier-checking · test-body-evaluation\n  engineer · convergence-diagnosis · test-approach-taxonomy\n  author   · polarity-decision · typed-relates-to\n           · implies-antecedent-grammar\n  orch.    · livelock-escalation-routing\n\nTool/skill scoping ADVISORY in v1 — PreToolUse gate provides\nthe actual safety boundary (hard sandbox deferred to v1.x).\nSub-agents spawn via Claude Code Task tool with subagent_type:\ndusk-<role>; Dusk materializes memory + injects skills BEFORE\nthe spawn call.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "card-roles",
      "originalText": "Sub-agent roles (9) · memory · tool scope (advisory in v1)\n\n1. Root Orchestrator   session   spawn + builds session-snapshot index\n2. Bead Orchestrator   bead      spawn + commit + diagnosis routing + livelock\n3. Decomposer          none      Read-only · typed relates_to (5 kinds)\n4. Scout               none      Read + grep + AST\n5. Engineer            bead      Write/Edit (gated) + Read + scoped Bash\n6. Verifier            none      Read-only · fresh per call · polarity-aware\n7. Test Runner         bead      Read + Bash(test-runner-cmd)\n8. Author              dialog    Authoring + Read · polarity-decision skill\n9. Conflict Resolver   none      Git ops + R/W · decorator-aware merge\n\nEngineer ⊥ Verifier asymmetry — PROTECTED (round-3):\n  Engineer persistent per bead → accumulates context via\n      structured DUAL-CHANNEL bead memory (impl + test-authoring)\n  Verifier fresh per call → spawn payload IDENTICAL across iters\n      Diagnosis goes to Bead Orchestrator ONLY (never Verifier)\n  Validated by fresh-Verifier audit (3 axes incl. citation precision)\n\nKey skills (round-3):\n  verifier · polarity-aware-evaluation\n           · implies-evaluation (deterministic antecedents)\n           · quantifier-checking · test-body-evaluation\n  engineer · convergence-diagnosis · test-approach-taxonomy\n  author   · polarity-decision · typed-relates-to\n           · implies-antecedent-grammar\n  orch.    · livelock-escalation-routing\n\nTool/skill scoping ADVISORY in v1 — PreToolUse gate provides\nthe actual safety boundary (hard sandbox deferred to v1.x).\nSub-agents spawn via Claude Code Task tool with subagent_type:\ndusk-<role>; Dusk materializes memory + injects skills BEFORE\nthe spawn call.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "YzHoEfM5j2EibsRyhWy3t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 86.2109375,
      "y": 8906.2109375,
      "width": 404.794921875,
      "height": 413.99999999999994,
      "angle": 0,
