      "updated": 1781010879884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sub-agent memory scopes (v9 · round-3 hardened)\n\nmemory: none — Fresh per invocation. Spawn payload IDENTICAL\n   across iterations (no diagnosis leak). Used by: Verifier,\n   Decomposer, Scout, Conflict Resolver.\n\nmemory: bead — Persists across short-cycle iters + long-cycle\n   samples + test-execution feedback. Used by: Engineer,\n   Test Runner, Bead Orchestrator. STRUCTURED DUAL-CHANNEL format:\n     - Current diagnosis (Bead-Orchestrator-scoped routing signal)\n     - Approaches tried (impl)\n     - Approaches tried (test-authoring) with Triple-slot focus tag\n     - Verifier signals (last 3 verdicts)\n     - Intent set in scope · Files being modified\n   Mechanical/templated compaction — NEVER LLM-summarized.\n   File at .ia/runtime/beads/<bead-id>/<role>.md.\n\nmemory: dialog — Author's 5-stage flow.\n   .ia/runtime/dialogs/<dialog-id>/. 24h GC TTL.\n\nmemory: session — Root Orchestrator.\n   .ia/runtime/session/<role>.md.\n\nImplement checkpoint (round-3 — NOT a memory scope):\n   .ia/runtime/implement/<resume_token>.json. 24h TTL. Survives\n   harness crashes. Drives dusk_implement pause/resume contract.\n\nSub-agent spawn mechanism:\n   Claude Code Task tool with subagent_type: dusk-<role>. Dusk\n   materializes memory + injects skills BEFORE the spawn call.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "card-memory",
      "originalText": "Sub-agent memory scopes (v9 · round-3 hardened)\n\nmemory: none — Fresh per invocation. Spawn payload IDENTICAL\n   across iterations (no diagnosis leak). Used by: Verifier,\n   Decomposer, Scout, Conflict Resolver.\n\nmemory: bead — Persists across short-cycle iters + long-cycle\n   samples + test-execution feedback. Used by: Engineer,\n   Test Runner, Bead Orchestrator. STRUCTURED DUAL-CHANNEL format:\n     - Current diagnosis (Bead-Orchestrator-scoped routing signal)\n     - Approaches tried (impl)\n     - Approaches tried (test-authoring) with Triple-slot focus tag\n     - Verifier signals (last 3 verdicts)\n     - Intent set in scope · Files being modified\n   Mechanical/templated compaction — NEVER LLM-summarized.\n   File at .ia/runtime/beads/<bead-id>/<role>.md.\n\nmemory: dialog — Author's 5-stage flow.\n   .ia/runtime/dialogs/<dialog-id>/. 24h GC TTL.\n\nmemory: session — Root Orchestrator.\n   .ia/runtime/session/<role>.md.\n\nImplement checkpoint (round-3 — NOT a memory scope):\n   .ia/runtime/implement/<resume_token>.json. 24h TTL. Survives\n   harness crashes. Drives dusk_implement pause/resume contract.\n\nSub-agent spawn mechanism:\n   Claude Code Task tool with subagent_type: dusk-<role>. Dusk\n   materializes memory + injects skills BEFORE the spawn call.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
