      "updated": 1781010879884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Atomic commit format (Conventional Commits + trailers)\n\nfeat(api): add cursor decoding for paginated lists\n\nImplements cursor decode with explicit\nquery-param shape and typed\nCursorState|DecodeError return per\nthe new intent.\n\nIntent: api/pagination/cursor-only/cursor-decode\n         [query-param, return-payload, error-on-malformed]\nIntent: api/auth-required [authorization-required]\nTest-Intent: .../cursor-decode/unit-tests\nTest-Intent: .../cursor-decode/integration-tests\nBead-id: bd_2026052600001\nVerdict-id: vd_2026052600001\nTest-Verdict-id: tv_2026052600001       (round-3)\nTrace-id: tr_2026052600001\nVerifier-model: claude-sonnet-4-6\nTest-Runner-model: claude-sonnet-4-6\nLong-cycle-samples: 10                  (round-3, was 3)\nTest-Suites-passed: 2\n\n— Conditional trailers (round-3) —\nPartial: true                              when commit via\nDeferred-Intent: <intent-path>             Recovery Ladder L1\nVerifier-bypassed-test-intent:             when livelock resolved\n   <test-intent-path>[<triple-id>]         via accept_test_as_is\n\n— Subject + body are human prose.\n— One commit per bead. Step 8 rebase recognizes Partial: true\n  trailers and suppresses snapshot_drift warnings on deferred\n  intents.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "card-commit",
      "originalText": "Atomic commit format (Conventional Commits + trailers)\n\nfeat(api): add cursor decoding for paginated lists\n\nImplements cursor decode with explicit\nquery-param shape and typed\nCursorState|DecodeError return per\nthe new intent.\n\nIntent: api/pagination/cursor-only/cursor-decode\n         [query-param, return-payload, error-on-malformed]\nIntent: api/auth-required [authorization-required]\nTest-Intent: .../cursor-decode/unit-tests\nTest-Intent: .../cursor-decode/integration-tests\nBead-id: bd_2026052600001\nVerdict-id: vd_2026052600001\nTest-Verdict-id: tv_2026052600001       (round-3)\nTrace-id: tr_2026052600001\nVerifier-model: claude-sonnet-4-6\nTest-Runner-model: claude-sonnet-4-6\nLong-cycle-samples: 10                  (round-3, was 3)\nTest-Suites-passed: 2\n\n— Conditional trailers (round-3) —\nPartial: true                              when commit via\nDeferred-Intent: <intent-path>             Recovery Ladder L1\nVerifier-bypassed-test-intent:             when livelock resolved\n   <test-intent-path>[<triple-id>]         via accept_test_as_is\n\n— Subject + body are human prose.\n— One commit per bead. Step 8 rebase recognizes Partial: true\n  trailers and suppresses snapshot_drift warnings on deferred\n  intents.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
