      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Observability — trace event schema (v9 · round-3)\n\ntype SubAgentTrace = {\n  schema_version: 1,                    (v9)\n  trace_id, bead_id?, parent_trace_id?,\n  role: '…' (9 roles incl. test-runner),\n  invocation_site: '…' (incl. test-execution),\n  model, prompt_tokens, completion_tokens,\n  latency_ms, cost_usd,\n  input_summary?, output_summary?,\n\n  // Index coherency (round-3)\n  index_snapshot_id?,\n\n  // Long-cycle confirmation pass (round-3)\n  confirmation_of_trace_id?,\n  confirmation_pass_outcome?:\n     'confirmed_reject' | 'flaky_verdict_dismissed',\n\n  // Stuck-bead debugging (round-3, short-cycle only)\n  iteration_number?,\n  verdict_delta_from_prior?,\n  failing_triple_set?,\n  engineer_change_summary?,\n\n  // Bead Orchestrator traces only (asymmetry guarantee)\n  convergence_diagnosis_present?,\n  stuckness_detector_state?,\n  verifier_livelock_signal?:\n    {failing_triple, slot_focus, structural_approach_count},\n\n  // Verifier-only\n  agreement_with_pair?, ground_truth?,\n  test_runner_command?, test_pass_count?, test_fail_count?,\n  skills_loaded?\n}\n\nTraces → .ia/observability/traces.jsonl\nVerifier traces NEVER carry diagnosis fields\n(diagnosis lives in Bead Orchestrator scope only).",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "card-observability",
      "originalText": "Observability — trace event schema (v9 · round-3)\n\ntype SubAgentTrace = {\n  schema_version: 1,                    (v9)\n  trace_id, bead_id?, parent_trace_id?,\n  role: '…' (9 roles incl. test-runner),\n  invocation_site: '…' (incl. test-execution),\n  model, prompt_tokens, completion_tokens,\n  latency_ms, cost_usd,\n  input_summary?, output_summary?,\n\n  // Index coherency (round-3)\n  index_snapshot_id?,\n\n  // Long-cycle confirmation pass (round-3)\n  confirmation_of_trace_id?,\n  confirmation_pass_outcome?:\n     'confirmed_reject' | 'flaky_verdict_dismissed',\n\n  // Stuck-bead debugging (round-3, short-cycle only)\n  iteration_number?,\n  verdict_delta_from_prior?,\n  failing_triple_set?,\n  engineer_change_summary?,\n\n  // Bead Orchestrator traces only (asymmetry guarantee)\n  convergence_diagnosis_present?,\n  stuckness_detector_state?,\n  verifier_livelock_signal?:\n    {failing_triple, slot_focus, structural_approach_count},\n\n  // Verifier-only\n  agreement_with_pair?, ground_truth?,\n  test_runner_command?, test_pass_count?, test_fail_count?,\n  skills_loaded?\n}\n\nTraces → .ia/observability/traces.jsonl\nVerifier traces NEVER carry diagnosis fields\n(diagnosis lives in Bead Orchestrator scope only).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15
    },
    {
      "id": "snGgIppNpokZ_jpyk3vYP",
      "type": "text",
